# GitNexus code-knowledge-graph index (local, large, regenerated by `gitnexus analyze`)
.gitnexus/
.gitnexusrc

# GitNexus auto-generated skills (regenerated by `gitnexus analyze --skills`)
# `.claude/skills` symlinks to `.agents/skills`, so ignore the real paths
.agents/skills/gitnexus/
.agents/skills/generated/

# Root agent entry files are local-only: CLAUDE.md is a symlink to AGENTS.md,
# and the authoritative rules live at .claude/CLAUDE.md. GitNexus `analyze`
# refreshes its block in both on re-index. (Root-anchored only.)
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
.playwright-mcp/
# Playwright CLI 会话快照（本地调试产物）
.playwright-cli/
